        "duration_ms": 200
      },
      {
        "color": "#FFD700",
        "duration_ms": 200
      },
      {
        "color": "#00A000",
        "duration_ms": 200
      }
    ],
    "comment": "Shared dynamic border rule for Debug Posts and Debug-only Settings cards (Color View and Date View). Uses the standard change_count + sequence rule language; -1 means infinite cycling."
  },
